sentences.text:
As per the case of the petitioner, she was aged about 26 years,
for proof of her age, she has produced copy of aadhar card marked as Ex.P.15, wherein it is clearly mentioned date of birth of the petitioner as 01.01.1997 and the alleged accident was occurred on 11.05.2023,
accordingly relying on Ex.P.15 her age is considered about 27 years as on the date of accident.
